{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111113","id":2877848582,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6riHwG","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111113","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111113.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111113.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111113","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111113/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111113/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111113/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6573fd091ac03be729b5de159eb4bbf31dd075f4","number":111113,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Tree: Prevent auto-scrolling from dragging and dropping targets","user":{"login":"Ayanakoji77","id":123665821,"node_id":"U_kgDOB179nQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123665821?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayanakoji77","html_url":"https://github.com/Ayanakoji77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayanakoji77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayanakoji77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayanakoji77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayanakoji77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayanakoji77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayanakoji77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayanakoji77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayanakoji77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ayanakoji77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes #93755\r\n- Fixes #111005\r\n- *Bugsquad edit:* Fixes #113670 according to [this comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113670#issuecomment-3667858641)\r\n\r\n**Current Behavior**\r\n\r\nWhen any object for example ui dock tab or  a invalid file type is near the tree control system , then the tree starts to auto scroll (File System Dock or Scene Manager Dock) , even if the dock cannot accept the drop .\r\n\r\n**New Behavior**\r\n\r\nif the Tree is a valid target for the currently dragged object . This fix the auto scroll movement of the tree control systems.\r\n\r\n**Testing the fix**\r\n1.Open a new project.\r\n2. Move the filesystem dock above the scene manager dock .\r\n3. Make sure the filesystem has multiple files.\r\n4. Try to hover any file or a ui dock name (Scene or Import or Filesystem )  near or over the Scene Manager or vice versa check.\r\n5. The auto scroll should not happen if not respective Tree Drop area are present.\r\n\r\n**MRP from the issue and added some scenes in the scene manager**\r\n\r\n[MRP-filesystem-scroll.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22636509/MRP-filesystem-scroll.zip)\r\n\r\n**Video Demonstration**\r\nNew Video\r\n[Screencast_20251004_213629.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f30e3e1e-0936-49e1-91ab-0c18faa1a761)\r\n\r\nUpdated Video\r\n[Screencast_20251225_203452.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed7edd40-1e1a-43ee-8bc1-8907431831d3)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topi